WEBVTT

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:28.380
Listen, Fena!
Listen very closely!

00:00:28.380 --> 00:00:31.050
Go to Eden--

00:00:32.660 --> 00:00:33.300
Fena!

00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:36.550
Yukimaru!

00:00:37.750 --> 00:00:40.930
I'll find you, no matter what!
Just stay alive!

00:00:41.260 --> 00:00:43.490
Yukimaru! Yukimaru!

00:00:43.490 --> 00:00:45.830
Yukimaru!

00:01:21.240 --> 00:01:22.140
Fena.

00:03:08.540 --> 00:03:10.660
Sure, I've heard the rumors.

00:03:10.710 --> 00:03:14.130
No, she really is a beautiful girl.

00:03:14.210 --> 00:03:16.040
She can't be <i>that</i> great.

00:03:16.130 --> 00:03:18.800
- You haven't seen her, have you?
- I only know the rumors.

00:03:18.880 --> 00:03:20.220
When you see her, you'll understand.

00:03:20.420 --> 00:03:23.640
Skin as pale as snow,
and hair that gleams like silver.

00:03:23.720 --> 00:03:25.100
Oh?

00:03:25.890 --> 00:03:28.890
So, who won the bid
for her <i>jus primae noctis?</i>

00:03:28.970 --> 00:03:31.100
That young upstart, I hear.

00:03:31.560 --> 00:03:33.060
That weirdo...

00:03:33.150 --> 00:03:34.520
Now, now...

00:03:34.610 --> 00:03:37.730
What color does her skin turn
when she gets flushed?

00:03:37.820 --> 00:03:38.530
Forget it.

00:03:38.610 --> 00:03:41.740
Wonder all you want,
you'll never know.

00:03:41.820 --> 00:03:43.200
I beg your pardon?

00:03:43.320 --> 00:03:45.280
You're in the same boat as me!

00:03:46.240 --> 00:03:48.120
Otto, surely you're not thinking--

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:51.830
We must work fast.

00:04:01.840 --> 00:04:04.380
You really do have lovely hair.

00:04:04.800 --> 00:04:08.470
I can see why they call you
the White Marginal.

00:04:09.140 --> 00:04:12.390
Pretty soon, men from all over the Continent
will come flocking to see you.

00:04:13.440 --> 00:04:14.900
I couldn't care less.

00:04:16.520 --> 00:04:19.570
Oh, dear. You still can't get him
out of your mind?

00:04:19.650 --> 00:04:21.530
That black-eyed knight
of yours?

00:04:21.690 --> 00:04:24.030
You don't even know
if he's still alive.

00:04:24.110 --> 00:04:26.910
What was his name again?
Yookie? Yookoo?

00:04:28.580 --> 00:04:30.910
Oo, so scary...

00:04:32.580 --> 00:04:33.460
Angie.

00:04:34.670 --> 00:04:40.420
I can't do this. I can't just let some man
I've never met have his way with me.

00:04:40.750 --> 00:04:42.420
I won't! I won't do it!

00:04:44.760 --> 00:04:47.430
Hang on... Are you still--

00:04:47.760 --> 00:04:49.760
You bet I am! Hang on!

00:04:49.850 --> 00:04:52.430
I have some cunning plans
worked up for this exact occasion!

00:04:52.770 --> 00:04:54.430
Come over here,
and I'll walk you through them!

00:04:54.980 --> 00:04:55.940
Come on!

00:04:56.650 --> 00:04:57.940
Fena Houtman's
Flawless Escape Plan Guidebook Pt. 23!

00:04:56.650 --> 00:04:57.940
Observe!

00:04:58.310 --> 00:05:00.610
You're all the way up to 23, huh?

00:05:00.650 --> 00:05:01.940
Plan A!

00:05:01.940 --> 00:05:08.450
Sleeping

00:05:01.940 --> 00:05:08.450
Dash!

00:05:01.940 --> 00:05:08.450
Dummies

00:05:01.940 --> 00:05:08.450
Escape into the forest!

00:05:02.280 --> 00:05:06.950
- While everyone is fast asleep--
- Does this island ever sleep?

00:05:06.950 --> 00:05:08.030
Right you are!

00:05:08.030 --> 00:05:10.240
Next! Plan B!

00:05:08.450 --> 00:05:16.960
Store

00:05:08.450 --> 00:05:16.960
Off to the Ares District

00:05:08.450 --> 00:05:16.960
Dash!

00:05:08.450 --> 00:05:16.960
Dummy     Dummy

00:05:10.240 --> 00:05:13.200
While doing my morning shopping,
I distract my escorts

00:05:13.200 --> 00:05:16.080
and slip through the Turkish market
and enter the Ares District!

00:05:17.540 --> 00:05:18.880
I've seen that one before.

00:05:18.960 --> 00:05:22.000
Ah, okay.
Moving right along, then!

00:05:21.460 --> 00:05:31.220
Duped

00:05:21.460 --> 00:05:31.220
Payoff

00:05:21.460 --> 00:05:31.220
Dummy

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:23.510
Plan C!

00:05:23.510 --> 00:05:25.420
I bribe the sentry at the western gate, and--

00:05:25.420 --> 00:05:27.970
Bribe him with what?
You've got no money.

00:05:27.970 --> 00:05:31.220
- With my body...
- Isn't that why you want to escape?

00:05:31.510 --> 00:05:33.600
Right you are!
I'm never gonna do that!

00:05:33.680 --> 00:05:37.100
Which means that Plan C
is also a bust!

00:05:37.190 --> 00:05:39.350
Is this your idea of
"cunning" plans?

00:05:41.520 --> 00:05:43.110
In the end,

00:05:43.650 --> 00:05:47.240
any plan I come up with
boils down to money!

00:05:47.320 --> 00:05:48.530
Well, duh.

00:05:48.610 --> 00:05:50.570
Without money,
I can't get on a ship,

00:05:50.660 --> 00:05:53.540
and even if I made it to the Continent,
I couldn't support myself!

00:05:53.620 --> 00:05:56.120
So you finally figured it out.
Congratulations.

00:05:56.710 --> 00:05:58.620
And that's when it hit me.

00:05:58.710 --> 00:06:00.630
I figured out how to get my hands
on some money first!

00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:03.630
- I'm not lending you any!
- Nope, not you!

00:06:04.800 --> 00:06:06.880
Angie, money is a funny thing.

00:06:06.970 --> 00:06:10.140
Where there's none, there's none at all,
but where there's some, there's lots!

00:06:10.800 --> 00:06:14.140
So I just need to steal every last
penny of that ill-gotten money!

00:06:14.640 --> 00:06:18.310
Hang on, <i>that's</i> why you put
yourself up for auction?

00:06:18.390 --> 00:06:21.150
- To ID the richest guys?
- Plan D!

00:06:22.230 --> 00:06:24.110
Presenting the Witch's Whammy.

00:06:24.190 --> 00:06:26.740
It's an aphrodisiac, but according
to Elza the pharmacist,

00:06:26.820 --> 00:06:30.490
if you mix in a double dose into wine, it acts
as a sleeping potion that works instantly!

00:06:30.780 --> 00:06:32.160
Apparently.

00:06:32.570 --> 00:06:34.370
That crazy old lady...

00:06:34.450 --> 00:06:37.120
My plan is to use this to knock out
that pampered farm boy

00:06:37.200 --> 00:06:40.120
and help myself to all the money
he used to buy me with!

00:06:40.210 --> 00:06:42.920
Guards will be standing watch
outside all night!

00:06:44.250 --> 00:06:46.800
The second floor of the "Tower of Babylon"
is used for <i>primae noctis,</i> right?

00:06:46.800 --> 00:06:49.050
1) The Tower of Babylon

00:06:47.260 --> 00:06:49.300
It sits on the coast,
so there aren't many guards.

00:06:49.050 --> 00:06:50.630
2) Here!

00:06:49.300 --> 00:06:50.590
If I tie curtains together
to make a rope,

00:06:50.970 --> 00:06:52.840
it'll be a snap to climb down
the tower wall!

00:06:51.180 --> 00:06:52.390
Here!

00:06:53.300 --> 00:06:56.310
- They'll spot you immediately.
- They won't! At least not until morning!

00:06:57.390 --> 00:07:00.140
Because I'll be in the middle
of my <i>primae noctis.</i>

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:04.360
By the time anyone catches on,
I'll be on a ship for the Continent!

00:07:04.480 --> 00:07:08.860
I'll be crossing the sea of hope with the wind
at my back, basking in the morning light!

00:07:09.780 --> 00:07:11.820
What're the chances
that the potion won't work?

00:07:11.950 --> 00:07:13.120
Not zero.

00:07:13.240 --> 00:07:15.660
And that you won't
be able to get a boat?

00:07:15.740 --> 00:07:18.330
- Not zero.
- Your plan stinks.

00:07:20.250 --> 00:07:23.500
A-Adventures always carry
an element of risk, Angie!

00:07:23.580 --> 00:07:25.710
When did this become
an adventure?

00:07:25.790 --> 00:07:29.760
Say what you like, but I'm setting out
into a brave new world tonight!

00:07:29.880 --> 00:07:31.220
You can't talk me out of it!

00:07:31.300 --> 00:07:34.090
I won't stop you. Your plan will just
run into another hiccup again anyway.

00:07:34.890 --> 00:07:38.390
They'll be coming for you soon.
You need to get ready.

00:07:54.490 --> 00:07:55.620
Angie...

00:07:55.910 --> 00:07:57.990
Do you know what day today is?

00:07:58.080 --> 00:08:00.370
Come on, the clock's ticking.

00:08:00.660 --> 00:08:02.750
Today marks ten years to the day.

00:08:03.250 --> 00:08:06.750
Ten years since I washed ashore
on this island.

00:08:12.090 --> 00:08:14.550
Fena, it's time. Let's go.

00:08:29.070 --> 00:08:33.860
Listen, Fena. Maxiver, Jr.
is a bit of an odd fellow.

00:08:36.280 --> 00:08:39.950
His behavior might take you aback,
but play along and give yourself to him.

00:08:40.040 --> 00:08:41.240
You'll get used to it.

00:08:41.370 --> 00:08:44.410
If he takes a liking to you,
he'll spend money like water.

00:08:44.960 --> 00:08:47.960
Your cut is one-tenth
of whatever he spends.

00:08:48.040 --> 00:08:49.630
Don't try to fudge the numbers.

00:08:50.800 --> 00:08:52.010
What's the matter?

00:08:53.050 --> 00:08:57.010
Why are we still going up?
We've gone past the second floor.

00:08:57.140 --> 00:08:59.930
Second floor? Oh, you mean
the traditional room.

00:09:00.390 --> 00:09:05.440
It was at Junior's request. He's been granted
the use of the top floor for tonight.

00:09:07.730 --> 00:09:09.610
The top floor?

00:09:09.310 --> 00:09:11.360
Planned!

00:09:10.770 --> 00:09:12.070
Yay, me!

00:09:11.360 --> 00:09:12.360
Top floor here

00:09:12.070 --> 00:09:13.820
Ah, I'm gonna die!
Farewell, cruel world!

00:09:16.240 --> 00:09:18.240
What's gotten into you?

00:09:19.160 --> 00:09:21.540
It's too high up!
I can't get away!

00:09:22.740 --> 00:09:25.750
Come on, Fena, you'll be late.
Get up!

00:09:25.870 --> 00:09:27.120
My stomach...

00:09:27.330 --> 00:09:30.130
My stomach hurts!
And my head! I'm gonna barf!

00:09:30.250 --> 00:09:32.250
- Oh, come on...
- I hurt all over!

00:09:32.340 --> 00:09:34.970
Every bone in my body is broken!
Ow! Ow! Ow! Ow! Ow!

00:09:35.050 --> 00:09:36.380
Huh?

00:09:37.380 --> 00:09:39.390
Quit messing around, damn it!

00:09:39.470 --> 00:09:41.720
I refuse to go through with it!
Not ever! I'd sooner die!

00:09:41.810 --> 00:09:44.520
I'm going back to my room!
Get your filthy hand off me!

00:09:52.770 --> 00:09:56.280
You'll behave yourself if you know
what's good for you, Fena.

00:09:56.570 --> 00:09:59.780
If you decide to defy us...
Show her what to expect.

00:10:02.780 --> 00:10:04.290
Listen, Fena.

00:10:04.830 --> 00:10:08.620
Don't get too high an opinion of yourself.
There's plenty more where you came--

00:10:10.750 --> 00:10:12.920
Old-timer! What are you
doing back--

00:10:26.470 --> 00:10:27.930
Are you all right, Lady Fena?

00:10:28.850 --> 00:10:31.520
I'm fine, you're--
Mister, your nose! It's all bloody!

00:10:32.310 --> 00:10:34.770
Oh, this is just a scratch!

00:10:34.980 --> 00:10:39.610
Wh-Who are you?! Don't you know
where you are?! This is a royally-sanctioned--

00:10:37.740 --> 00:10:39.610
Home run to the left-field bleachers!

00:10:41.320 --> 00:10:43.490
Lady Fena! We're here
to rescue you!

00:10:44.660 --> 00:10:46.490
"Lady Fena"?

00:10:48.080 --> 00:10:49.580
"Rescue"?

00:10:49.660 --> 00:10:51.370
S-Salman?!

00:10:56.340 --> 00:10:58.130
Otto?!

00:10:59.550 --> 00:11:02.470
Lady Fena, it's been far too long!

00:11:02.550 --> 00:11:06.350
You've grown into such a lovely--
No, this isn't the time!

00:11:06.640 --> 00:11:08.520
We're here to rescue you!
Let's escape!

00:11:09.060 --> 00:11:11.900
We have a ship standing by!
Follow us!

00:11:12.520 --> 00:11:13.730
Come, Lady Fena!

00:11:13.810 --> 00:11:16.900
Hang on, I'm still a little fuzzy
on what's happening here...

00:11:17.690 --> 00:11:19.530
Lady Fena, pursuers
are coming!

00:11:19.740 --> 00:11:22.160
- Please make haste!
- You can trust us!

00:11:40.590 --> 00:11:42.050
Manager?

00:11:42.380 --> 00:11:44.590
You're not going anywhere, Fena.

00:11:44.680 --> 00:11:49.720
You're just a harlot who's only
good for being made love to by men!

00:11:49.970 --> 00:11:51.690
- Now be a good girl and--
- Let go of me.

00:11:52.310 --> 00:11:56.310
Let go of me, you creepy jerk
with a creepy little mustache!

00:12:00.650 --> 00:12:03.200
- Lady Fena!
- Lady Fena!

00:12:04.220 --> 00:12:06.680
Hm? What did you say?

00:12:07.430 --> 00:12:09.100
You'll have to speak up.

00:12:09.180 --> 00:12:10.760
She escaped.

00:12:12.140 --> 00:12:14.310
I thought I told you
to speak up.

00:12:14.640 --> 00:12:16.520
She escaped the--

00:12:16.600 --> 00:12:20.060
Fena-- That is, the White Marginal
has escaped!

00:12:21.780 --> 00:12:24.820
My bride-to-be escaped?
That's what you're telling me?

00:12:28.360 --> 00:12:31.370
Are you kidding me? Get your asses
out there and bring her back,

00:12:31.450 --> 00:12:35.250
you bunch of useless morons!

00:12:39.000 --> 00:12:40.750
It's the alarm bell!
We've been found out!

00:12:40.840 --> 00:12:46.090
I have ears! Lady Fena! We have
a ship hidden on the eastern shore!

00:12:46.220 --> 00:12:47.760
Hang in there just a while longer!

00:12:47.840 --> 00:12:49.840
- But east is the other way!
- It's what?!

00:12:52.180 --> 00:12:53.350
Ouch!

00:12:56.430 --> 00:12:58.390
- It's the other way!
- You idjit!

00:13:06.610 --> 00:13:08.990
Why on earth are there
so many guards?

00:13:09.660 --> 00:13:12.200
This island is run by the country.

00:13:12.330 --> 00:13:14.410
Civilian military employee VIPs
use it too.

00:13:14.540 --> 00:13:16.250
Ah, that explains it...

00:13:22.250 --> 00:13:23.090
They're coming this way!

00:13:23.500 --> 00:13:25.210
- What do we do?
- Don't ask me!

00:13:25.300 --> 00:13:28.340
You got us into this mess
by taking us in the wrong direction!

00:13:28.420 --> 00:13:32.100
- It's not like you noticed it either!
- This is no time for bickering, you two!

00:13:35.720 --> 00:13:38.980
I'll draw them off.
You take Lady Fena and get away!

00:13:39.390 --> 00:13:40.230
Otto!

00:13:40.770 --> 00:13:42.940
Can you handle them?
That's quite a belly...

00:13:43.730 --> 00:13:46.480
Don't you worry about me!
This is all muscle!

00:13:47.150 --> 00:13:49.070
Good luck to you, Lady Fena.

00:13:50.780 --> 00:13:54.620
You face the Houtman knight
Otto the Blitz!

00:13:57.500 --> 00:13:59.460
Oh, I'm impressed!

00:13:59.540 --> 00:14:01.880
You've lost your hair,
but not your edge!

00:14:01.960 --> 00:14:04.040
Come along, Lady Fena,
we'd best be off.

00:14:04.130 --> 00:14:05.710
Otto, that was amazing!

00:14:05.880 --> 00:14:07.380
B-But I didn't--

00:14:20.730 --> 00:14:24.020
Oh, brother. They're going in
the wrong direction again.

00:14:24.110 --> 00:14:27.530
The dark of night and old eyes.
They couldn't possibly read the map.

00:14:27.650 --> 00:14:29.070
His hunch was on the money.

00:14:29.150 --> 00:14:32.030
- What do we do?
- The twins are there. They can handle it.

00:14:32.450 --> 00:14:34.530
Salman! You want to take us
to the eastern forest, right?

00:14:34.620 --> 00:14:35.580
That's right, Lady Fena!

00:14:35.660 --> 00:14:37.490
Then we're still going the wrong way!

00:14:37.580 --> 00:14:38.790
Beg pardon?

00:14:40.410 --> 00:14:42.620
- It's the other way!
- Nincompoop!

00:14:45.170 --> 00:14:45.920
Okay, got it!

00:14:46.000 --> 00:14:48.000
It'll be fastest to go through there.

00:14:48.800 --> 00:14:51.010
- Follow me, you two.
- Yes, miss.

00:14:51.090 --> 00:14:52.340
Hey! You three!

00:14:52.880 --> 00:14:54.340
What are you doing over there?

00:15:00.640 --> 00:15:02.390
- Lady Fena, go on ahead!
- Will do!

00:15:03.230 --> 00:15:06.110
- We'll never forget you!
- Why would you say that?!

00:15:08.230 --> 00:15:11.240
Let's see what you've got,
whippersnappers!

00:15:15.990 --> 00:15:18.080
I keep telling you, I have no idea.

00:15:18.160 --> 00:15:19.870
How could you possibly not know?!

00:15:20.290 --> 00:15:22.210
If I don't know where she is,
I don't know where she is!

00:15:22.290 --> 00:15:23.620
You liar!

00:15:23.710 --> 00:15:25.880
She had thought up
some nutty plan,

00:15:26.380 --> 00:15:28.380
but she's always
doing stuff like that.

00:15:28.670 --> 00:15:32.380
And she sure never said anything
about having outside help.

00:15:32.720 --> 00:15:35.390
Don't you try to keep secrets
from me, Angie!

00:15:35.550 --> 00:15:38.640
What would I possibly gain
from covering for her?

00:15:38.810 --> 00:15:41.020
- I've had about enough of your lip!
- Enough!

00:15:41.140 --> 00:15:45.520
Quit wasting my time
and playing dumb, you bitch!

00:15:59.280 --> 00:16:01.120
He didn't harm you, did he,

00:16:02.910 --> 00:16:04.120
...milady?

00:16:04.580 --> 00:16:08.130
N-No, I'm fine.

00:16:11.050 --> 00:16:14.920
I won't stand for ill treatment of women.
I suggest you remember your station.

00:16:15.630 --> 00:16:17.470
Scone bastard...

00:16:18.300 --> 00:16:22.430
Cody, please escort the lady out
and offer her some tea.

00:16:22.520 --> 00:16:23.730
Yes, sir.

00:16:36.570 --> 00:16:38.660
Do you think Salman is all right?

00:16:38.780 --> 00:16:42.290
Lady Fena, you needn't worry
about the likes of him.

00:16:43.580 --> 00:16:48.670
In his younger days, that old coot
was known as Salman the Onslaught.

00:16:48.750 --> 00:16:51.670
He is a spearman
who knows no equal!

00:16:51.840 --> 00:16:53.670
Wow, he is?

00:16:53.760 --> 00:16:57.430
He may be getting on in years,
but he can handle two guards.

00:16:57.510 --> 00:17:00.890
He'll deal with them in a flash
and catch up with us, just you see.

00:17:04.350 --> 00:17:07.190
- Okay, grandpa, where'd the girl go?
- Spill it!

00:17:07.310 --> 00:17:10.480
I don't know! I couldn't say!

00:17:10.610 --> 00:17:13.320
- Don't act like you've lost your dentures!
- I don't really know!

00:17:13.400 --> 00:17:16.570
- Want to lose your teeth for real?
- Have mercy!

00:17:17.450 --> 00:17:19.160
Shouldn't we help him?

00:17:19.240 --> 00:17:21.200
Let's wait until they
pull his teeth out!

00:17:21.320 --> 00:17:24.080
- Good idea, that sounds like fun.
- Right?

00:17:31.080 --> 00:17:35.250
Say, Otto... How did you find out
I was on this island?

00:17:38.050 --> 00:17:39.130
Otto?

00:17:39.300 --> 00:17:44.140
Hm? D-Did you
say something, Lady Fena?

00:17:44.430 --> 00:17:45.520
Shall we rest a bit?

00:17:45.600 --> 00:17:48.520
I'm fine... We must hurry along.

00:17:49.060 --> 00:17:50.730
You don't look fine to me.

00:17:50.810 --> 00:17:54.650
No matter how slow your pace,
moving ever onwards without resting

00:17:54.730 --> 00:17:56.610
is always fastest... in the end!

00:17:56.940 --> 00:17:58.110
Not if you--

00:17:58.190 --> 00:18:01.030
Are you sure that <i>you</i> aren't the
one who wants to rest, Lady Fena?

00:18:06.540 --> 00:18:07.790
Is that the wind?

00:18:13.580 --> 00:18:14.250
Otto!

00:18:18.880 --> 00:18:20.220
Otto!

00:18:20.550 --> 00:18:21.840
He's not dead.

00:18:22.050 --> 00:18:24.550
- The flat of my sword hit him!
- Otto!

00:18:24.640 --> 00:18:26.640
Otto! Let go!

00:18:26.760 --> 00:18:28.310
Let go of me!

00:18:30.430 --> 00:18:33.230
That's about enough of that, little lady.

00:18:33.980 --> 00:18:37.110
Look at this.
Her hair really is pure white.

00:18:37.360 --> 00:18:38.900
Just like the rumors say.

00:18:39.030 --> 00:18:41.900
She's the sacred maiden,
the White Marginal.

00:18:42.410 --> 00:18:44.320
Come on, let's kill her.

00:18:44.410 --> 00:18:46.450
Don't be in such a rush!

00:18:47.870 --> 00:18:49.040
No one will know?

00:18:49.120 --> 00:18:52.250
Once we're done with her,
we just need to throw her into the sea.

00:18:52.330 --> 00:18:54.630
The mako sharks
will take it from there.

00:18:55.500 --> 00:18:58.960
<i>Save me... Save me, Yukimaru!</i>

00:18:59.880 --> 00:19:02.470
Hey, don't even think about
leaving me out of--

00:19:04.840 --> 00:19:05.970
Hey, what's wrong?

00:19:06.050 --> 00:19:07.560
I dunno, he just--

00:19:08.470 --> 00:19:11.180
Hey, are you drunk or something?
Do your job and keep an eye--

00:19:14.310 --> 00:19:15.270
Wh-What the--

00:19:21.820 --> 00:19:23.990
Wh-Who's there?!
Show yourself!

00:19:34.620 --> 00:19:36.500
<i>Everything fell silent.</i>

00:19:41.010 --> 00:19:45.260
<i>All I remember was a sound
of metal like a ringing in my ears.</i>

00:19:46.300 --> 00:19:49.310
<i>A blade that gave off
an eerie glow.</i>

00:19:50.260 --> 00:19:52.310
<i>A helmet with antlers.</i>

00:19:53.890 --> 00:19:56.520
<i>Deep black eyes.</i>

00:20:11.540 --> 00:20:15.750
Er, I... Um... Thank you.

00:20:15.830 --> 00:20:16.540
Wait!

00:20:17.380 --> 00:20:21.920
Um, I... I know you!

00:20:29.260 --> 00:20:32.010
I've seen them before!
I remember your eyes!

00:20:32.140 --> 00:20:34.560
But if I'm wrong about you,
I apologize.

00:20:35.020 --> 00:20:38.600
I haven't met all that many
decent men.

00:20:38.690 --> 00:20:41.400
On this island,
all the men are sleazeballs!

00:20:41.480 --> 00:20:44.360
They treat women like property and never
apologize after being rough with them!

00:20:44.400 --> 00:20:46.700
They get mad a the drop of a hat,
and you never know what they're thinking!

00:20:47.200 --> 00:20:51.330
So basically, what I'm trying to say is...
I-Is you're completely different!

00:20:51.490 --> 00:20:53.200
I mean...

00:20:53.290 --> 00:20:58.120
I mean... you're different.
You're not like them.

00:21:00.040 --> 00:21:03.090
You... You saved me.

00:21:05.050 --> 00:21:08.470
You saved my life,
just like you did before.

00:21:10.010 --> 00:21:11.240
I'm positive.

00:21:12.050 --> 00:21:13.280
I know I'm right.

00:21:15.220 --> 00:21:19.000
You... You're Yukima--

00:21:30.330 --> 00:21:32.730
Uh-oh. Now he's gone and done it.

00:21:33.480 --> 00:21:35.100
Who even does that?

00:21:35.380 --> 00:21:38.800
It makes for quite
the shocking scene, though.

00:21:38.800 --> 00:21:40.350
Was that a good idea?

00:21:40.350 --> 00:21:43.260
Sure, why not? That's pretty much
all the loose ends dealt with.

00:21:43.260 --> 00:21:46.230
Well, I suppose there's
no danger to us.

00:21:54.920 --> 00:21:58.330
She's as yappy as ever.
So annoying...

00:22:04.820 --> 00:22:08.730
<i>Out cold in the forest,
I lay dreaming.</i>

00:22:09.720 --> 00:22:11.820
<i>Dreams of long-distant memories.</i>

00:22:15.710 --> 00:22:17.020
Wait for me...

00:22:19.730 --> 00:22:21.980
Yukimaru...
